Package: tensorplate-speech-runtime
Section: metapackages
Architecture: amd64
Build-Profiles: <pkg.tensorplate.speech-runtime>
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 tensorplate-serving (= ${binary:Version}),
 tensorplate-speech-runtime-base (= ${binary:Version}),
 tensorplate-speech-runtime-cublas (= ${binary:Version}),
 tensorplate-speech-runtime-cuda (= ${binary:Version}),
 tensorplate-speech-runtime-torch (= ${binary:Version}),
 tensorplate-speech-runtime-vad (= ${binary:Version}),
 tensorplate-speech-runtime-ct2 (= ${binary:Version}),
 tensorplate-speech-runtime-kokoro (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: TensorPlate speech runtime: all runner profiles (metapackage)
 Installs the whole speech runtime environment: the packages of the
 faster_whisper and kokoro runner profiles. Ships no files. The speech
 models themselves are provisioned with `tensorplate bundle provision`. The
 `tensorplate` metapackage neither depends on nor recommends it.
